{"title":"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 48","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>As soon as the human mind has alpha beta, the most important step has been taken. Subtract the most important step from the substance. Add the square root of the substance to the subtraction. Multiply the addition by the subtraction. Square the multiplication. Subtract the square root of the subtraction from the multiplication. Subtract the square root of the addition from the subtraction. Add the multiplication to the subtraction.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"background:#ffdddd; width:60%; border:2px solid #aa0000; margin:auto; text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding:10px;\">\n<p><b>This page has been proposed for <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Deletion_policy\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Deletion policy\">deletion</a>.</b> Reason: <b>bro</b>\n</p>\n<hr style=\"border:1px solid #aa0000;\" />\n<p><small>\n<b>Note to sysops:</b> Before deleting, please review: • <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere/2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_48\" title=\"Special:WhatLinksHere/2005 iTest Problems/Problem 48\">What links here</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Talk:2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_48&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Talk:2005 iTest Problems/Problem 48 (page does not exist)\">Discussion page</a> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_48&amp;action=history\">Edit history</a>\n</small>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017210146\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.022 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 11/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 837/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function coun